# Play test of Hermit's Table (CIPlay hermits_table, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The landing at the north cliff's foot (3 34, 2.6 m), the scaffold (x 1.5..4.5, z 29.5..32.5; ladders on its north face,
# the ledge deck east of it at 16.6 m, the top deck at 32.6 m), the table top at 33.2 m: the hut (0.75..5.25 11.75..16.25),
# the three levers at x 8 (z 18 stones, 20 footsteps, 22 tides).
island Hermit's Table
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Three Levers
wait 5
expect animals Goat 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
at 3 38 h=3
walk 3 37.5 to 3 35 h=2.6
zone foot
expect step 0
read Climber's note
expect step 1
open Climbers' box
at 6.4 31.5 h=17.4
zone ledge
expect step 1
open Ledge box
expect step 2
at 3 19 h=34.5
zone top
expect step 2
read The hermit's riddles
expect step 3
open Hermit's chest
expect message locked
use leverstones
expect shown birds
kill Screecher
use leverfootsteps
expect story hermitkey 1
expect step 4
use leverfootsteps
expect message The drawer is empty
open Hermit's chest
expect done
